  "description": "Powering through the mountains with ease. This is the motto our new ALLMTN CF 9 lives by – down to every last bolt. A sporty eMTB designed to deliver outstanding all-mountain performance, backed by clever engineering. To maximise the potential of the powerful Bosch Performance CX motor, we’ve rotated the motor in the carbon frame, providing better heat management and improved efficiency when your rides get tough. The newly developed kinematics with a horizontal shock, combined with the mullet wheel setup and 160mm RockShox fork, transform even rough downhill runs into smooth forest trails. And the 800Wh battery provides plenty of range, with the option to add 250Wh via a Range Extender for even longer rides. The ideal setup for long alpine adventures with maximum power.",
